SKU Lookup & Stock Updates (HashMap<String, Product>): Provides $O(1)$ average-time lookup, insertion, update, and deletion by unique SKU key without needing key sorting.Sorting Views (ArrayList<Product> + Comparable / Comparator): ArrayList supports random access and in-place sorting via List.sort(...). Comparable defines the primary domain sort (category, stock descending, name), while separate Comparator instances allow flexible alternative orderings (such as price descending) without mutating Product.Last 10 Movements Log (ArrayDeque<String>): Faster and cleaner than LinkedList for a bounded FIFO history buffer—addLast appends new events and removeFirst evicts the oldest entry once capacity reaches 10.Generic Repository Storage (HashMap<String, T> inside Repository<T>): Lets a single reusable generic container manage different entity types (Product, Supplier) by string identifier while preserving compile-time type safety. 
